<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Thursday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	 9.80 / 9.70  10.10 /10.00    10.50 /10.40</p>
<p>BPI			 9.80 / 9.70  10.10 /10.00    10.60 /10.50</p>
<p>Citibank		  9.85 / 9.75  10.15 /10.05    10.625/10.50</p>
<p>Hong Kong Bank	  9.85 / 9.75  10.15 /10.05    10.60 /10.50</p>
<p>Multinational	   9.80 / 9.725 10.05 / 9.975   10.60 /10.50</p>
<p>StandChart Bank	 9.90 / 9.80  10.10 /10.00    10.65 /10.55</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8937</p>
